{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Combine:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/8067b7090e066f93bf4fbf880cd7bd458a910934.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(-3)^4 - (-3)^3\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/7/767e2f6e060a34fef2be7c3fd721f68f0dee957c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad (-3)^{7} \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad (-3)^{1} \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 3^3\\cdot 2^2 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad 54 \\quad \\text{(E)} 3^1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"426\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/9/0c9f1c87a4d6bdc061a013cf10e7de0f69228478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-3)^4 - (-3)^3 = (81) -(-27) = 108 = \\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\quad 3^3 \\cdot 2^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"412\" height=\"31\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_8\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 8\"> Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_10\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041717\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 44/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 659/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 303/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 725/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.034      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.034      1 -total\n-->\